# Two Shredders are two triggers for the same second spell: the first spell Bot1 casts on turn 3 is the second Shredder
# itself (so the first Shredder does not trigger, it being only the first spell), the next Pyrite Spellbomb is the second
# spell, and both Shredders connive - each draws a Spellbomb, discards one (a nonland card) and grows to 2/4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Island
Mox Jet
Ledger Shredder
Ledger Shredder
Pyrite Spellbomb
Pyrite Spellbomb
Island
Pyrite Spellbomb
Pyrite Spellbomb
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ledger Shredder.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ledger Shredder.Cast
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ledger Shredder.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pyrite Spellbomb.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Pyrite Spellbomb)
Bot1.Choose(Pyrite Spellbomb)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ledger Shredder#1.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Ledger Shredder#2.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Ledger Shredder#1.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Ledger Shredder#2.Toughness = 4
